_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cloud-native","cpp","database","distributed-database","distributed-sql","distributed-sql-database","high-performance","kubernetes","multi-cloud","multi-region","scale-out","sql"],"visibility":"public","forks":1201,"open_issues":7608,"watchers":9958,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-19192](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-19192)\n### Description\n\nA crash occurs in VectorLSMInsertTask::Run() when the task continues executing after the corresponding vector index has already been destroyed:\n```\n[master]\nI1118 06:54:28.564405 25127 catalog_manager.cc:4584] Successfully created index pgvector_index [id=000034d40000300080000000000040fe] in yugabyte [id=000034d4000030008000000000000000] per request from\n...\nW1118 06:54:28.693451 26187 catalog_manager.cc:8103] Unable to find schema name for YSQL table yugabyte.pgvector_index id 000034d40000300080000000000040fe due to error: Not found (yb/master/ysql/ysql_manager.cc:299): Not found or invalid relnamespace oid for table oid : 16638: DOCDB_TABLE_NOT_COMMITTED (master error 43)\nI1118 06:54:28.694664 25127 ysql_ddl_handler.cc:202] YsqlDdlTxnCompleteCallback for transaction 45045895-c9f0-49db-be8c-cd75d0357239 is_committed: false, debug_caller_info ReportYsqlDdlTxnStatus\nI1118 06:54:28.694754 26220 ysql_ddl_handler.cc:376] YsqlDdlTxnCompleteCallbackInternal: table id: 000034d40000300080000000000040fe for transaction 45045895-c9f0-49db-be8c-cd75d0357239: Success: false ysql_ddl_txn_verifier_state: [contains_create_table_op: true]\nI1118 06:54:28.694782 26220 ysql_ddl_handler.cc:649] Delete table 000034d40000300080000000000040fe as part of rollback\nI1118 06:54:28.696918 26220 catalog_manager.cc:6401] MarkIndexInfoFromTableForDeletion table 000034d40000300080000000000040f9 index 000034d40000300080000000000040fe multi_stage=0\nI1118 06:54:28.696940 26220 catalog_manager.cc:6449] DeleteIndexInfoFromTable table 000034d40000300080000000000040f9 index 000034d40000300080000000000040fe\nI1118 06:54:28.700711 26220 catalog_manager.cc:6854] Deleting table: table: pgvector_index [id=000034d40000300080000000000040fe], Retained by: { snapshot_schedules: [] active_snapshot: 0 active_xcluster: 0 active_cdcsdk: 0 }\n\n[tserver]\nI1118 06:54:28.701464 24636 vector_lsm.cc:1182] T 833e2df0fa194e1d831c1b021951c682 P 329ce9cb07e84a43acf3a5f3697f3136 VI 000034d40000300080000000000040fe: Destroy\nI1118 06:54:28.701493 25576 vector_lsm.cc:1182] T 3988a3d3e69c42ec9eaaa5076028b528 P 329ce9cb07e84a43acf3a5f3697f3136 VI 000034d40000300080000000000040fe: Destroy\nI1118 06:54:28.706693 25627 vector_lsm.cc:1182] T 201e389d49344714ab9a5d12ad71716a P 329ce9cb07e84a43acf3a5f3697f3136 VI 000034d40000300080000000000040fe: Destroy\n...\nW1118 06:54:32.132423 26219 vector_lsm.cc:444] AllocateTasks: Long wait to allocate 2047 tasks, allocated: 6250, allowed: 1000\nW1118 06:54:33.132556 26219 vector_lsm.cc:444] AllocateTasks: Long wait to allocate 2047 tasks, allocated: 6250, allowed: 1000\n```\n\nThe issue happens because `VectorLSMInsertRegistry` does not handle shutdown correctly when it waits on task allocation during the shutting down: it exits immediately after active tasks are empty, but completing active tasks unblocks the wait loop to schedule more tasks.\n\n### Issue Type\n\nkind/bug\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\n\n- [x] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\n\n[DB-19192]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-19192?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/29400/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/29400/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":21434991313,"node_id":"REFE_lADOBlCVUc7cG0rRzwAAAAT9oALR","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/21434991313","actor":{"login":"spolitov","id":891914,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MTkxNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/891914?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov","html_url":"https://github.com/spolitov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"referenced","commit_id":"051b4f6e34fd8af107ca98cf2b1df674d0dbde61","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/commits/051b4f6e34fd8af107ca98cf2b1df674d0dbde61","created_at":"2025-12-08T19:40:25Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":21539046865,"node_id":"LE_lADOBlCVUc7cG0rRzwAAAAUD08XR","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/21539046865","actor":{"login":"rthallamko3","id":17170123,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTcwMTIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17170123?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3","html_url":"https://github.com/rthallamko3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rtha